<title>USA: U.S. hog and cattle slaughter estimates - trade.</title>
<headline>U.S. hog and cattle slaughter estimates - trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts estimate Monday's hog slaughter from 325,000 to 355,000 head versus 341,000 a week ago and 275,000 a year ago.</p>
<p>Cattle slaughter estimates ranged from 125,000 to 128,000 head against 127,000 a week ago and 123,000 a year ago.</p>
<p>((Jerry Bieszk 312-408-8725))</p>
